# Moss.xcframework is fetched and checksum-verified at `pod install` time (see
# MossReactNative.podspec). It must never be published: a packed copy would be
# used as-is, and the download script skips verification when the directory
# already exists — so a stale or unverified binary would ship silently.
#
# The `files` allow-list in package.json already enumerates only the sources,
# podspec and scripts. This is the second line of defence if that list is ever
# widened back to the whole `ios` directory.
Frameworks/
